---
import ProjectLayout from "../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro";
---
<ProjectLayout slug="home-value-score">
  <Fragment slot="intro">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="narrow">
        <h2 class="section-title">In short</h2>
        <div class="prose">
          <ul>
            <li><b>Method set first.</b> The hypothesis, definitions and pass/fail rule were <a href="https://github.com/amkashyap1220/Home-Value-Score/blob/main/docs/decisions.md">committed</a> before any price data was downloaded. Later changes are logged with a reason.</li>
            <li><b>Data from 10+ public sources</b>, joined at the zip level: Redfin, Census ACS and TIGER files, Illinois and Indiana school results, FBI crime data, the EPA walkability index, OpenStreetMap roads and Metra, CTA and South Shore Line stations.</li>
            <li><b>The tool:</b> readers set weights and targets for buying or renting, alone or with a partner, and the map shows their 20 best-value zips, each linked to listings. Try it in the <a href="/research/chicago-home-value.html">write-up</a>.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </Fragment>
</ProjectLayout>
